<mxCell id="legend" value="C4 model: Person (dark blue) &#8594; Container (blue, server-rendered UI) &#8594; Component (light blue, one box per internal/ Go package) &#8594; Container (SQLite / local disk). Dashed boundary = a logical grouping, not a deployable unit of its own (everything ships as one binary). Every component also reads/writes SQLite via internal/db — only the aggregate edge is drawn to avoid clutter." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="990" width="220" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>